OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed over ammonia attack
OL,4,Aon friend in Glasgow city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who soaked her friend in
OL,7,Fammonia after a dispute over money on a
OL,8,Fshopping trip has been jailed for three
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FGwen Dempster, 52, doused Lee McCluskey
OL,12,Fafter they got involved in a "heated
OL,13,Fargument" in Glasgow city centre last
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FGlasgow Sheriff Court heard that it
OL,17,Fdeveloped into a struggle, during which
OL,18,FDempster took a bottle of ammonia from
OL,19,Fa bag and threw it over her friend's
OL,20,Fhead and body.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
