OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed over ammonia attack
OL,4,Aon friend in Glasgow city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcCluskey said she had felt her skin
OL,7,Fburning and was later taken to hospital
OL,8,Falthough she discharged herself before
OL,9,Freceiving any treatment.
